                  "id": "p-supported-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the biggest concerns buyers have when shopping used is long-term reliability. That's why who you buy from matters just as much as what you buy. Sun State Trailers isn't just a place to find a used dump trailer; we're a long-term partner. Our team understands how downtime impacts your business, and we're here to help you choose equipment that supports your goals, not complicates them.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-supported-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>We take a straightforward approach:</strong>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
